{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "spanish", "appid": 924970, "month": "2025-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1743465600, "end_date": 1744156799, "month_true_total": 25, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:15:46 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "192312073", "author": {"steamid": "76561198838639985", "personaname": "BREACHER", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/patopatoganzo/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 1875, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 875, "last_played": 1747351170, "avatar": "d1bbe4b8adddf1b8db2a03023e093b8cfefc6ad1"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Solamente se vuelve disfrutable una vez te acostumbras, desde un inicio resulta ser un juego increíblemente PESADO, ni un solo respiro entre hordas, una cantidad enferma de cartas de habilidad tanto antes como durante la partida que en un punto ni siquiera sabes que tanta cosa llevas encima. Lo mismo con al gameplay, se vuelve muy poco disfrutable entre mutaciones de infectados especiales y comunes, bots señalando objetivos sin parar y eventos por doquier. Jugar back 4 blood se siente como ser obligado a comer 3 kilos de pastel en una sentada", "timestamp_created": 1744139326, "timestamp_updated": 1744139326, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192267614", "author": {"steamid": "76561198253404088", "personaname": "DonGrizzly", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DonGrizzly16/", "num_games_owned": 172, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 8424, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7339, "last_played": 1773285225, "avatar": "ca73818058c3a84b302b10dc4b53941dc9bf1a77"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Es muy buen juego, le falta que le den amor", "timestamp_created": 1744084589, "timestamp_updated": 1744084589, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192252850", "author": {"steamid": "76561198008244230", "personaname": "Ayame", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ayame10/", "num_games_owned": 717, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 148, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 74, "last_played": 1780101555, "avatar": "bb8c280172f6901715367e64507bfd2db23ccf3e"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Es un led4dead pero que se ve algo mejor, y bueno, misma mecánica pero otros bichos dando porsaco.\nExcelente juego para jugar con tus amigos, en solitario jugar con extranjeros se te hace algo extraño, pero mejor que solo o con npcs, ya que el juego entra en modo cooperativo contigo para ayudarte a avanzar, cosa que a veces la IA no es muy efectiva.\nLo recomiendo, no hay sustos ni mounstros tan buenos como en el led4dead, pero está bien.", "timestamp_created": 1744065394, "timestamp_updated": 1744065394, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192194868", "author": {"steamid": "76561198976763999", "personaname": "Rixuryu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198976763999/", "num_games_owned": 46, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 22, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 22, "last_played": 1735413073, "avatar": "7db1e68f6cc0636cd33c27ad124781ebd4e62df8"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "bueno", "timestamp_created": 1744000545, "timestamp_updated": 1744000545, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192045274", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045911240", "personaname": "Zubi Fett", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198045911240/", "num_games_owned": 210, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 1180, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1180, "last_played": 1743858575, "avatar": "2b475fb471712e1a61a75fbd6844e74a25506521"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Si lo compras barato, con descuento, le sacarás mucho provecho. Es divertido y no hace falta decir más ni hacer comparaciones. Es un juego al que le puedes dedicar fácilmente entre 15 y 20 horas, e incluso más si te engancha y sigues jugando en las dificultades de mayor nivel.\r\n\r\nUna crítica que haría es su sistema de cartas, que es excesivamente aleatorio y tiene demasiadas cartas. Sin embargo, si te gusta el tema de las estadísticas a fondo, quizás lo encuentres un punto positivo.", "timestamp_created": 1743860604, "timestamp_updated": 1743860604, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.528487205505371094", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}